{"body":{"text":["**page:** what hosts glass in a browser, and decides little."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC00W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**reader:** the component the page draws, search above the answer, given the query's text."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC00X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**pill:** one step of a query, shown in the bar."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC00Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**breadcrumb:** where the page stands, from home through the wholes above the holon the reader shows, each a way up; at rest, the top of the page."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC00Z","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**λ:** the expression button at the breadcrumb's end, opening the bar in its place."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC010","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**inspector:** what right-click opens, the page's: the place clicked, the component drawing it, the uses it was reached through, and the holon it shows."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC011","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**look:** how components look on one surface, shipped with them, drawn with the chassis's tokens, opened as variables."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC012","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**problem:** the component the chassis draws in place of a drawing that failed, given what failed."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC013","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**morph:** a component's new render laid over the one shown, changing only what differs, so what the browser keeps stays."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC014","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**overlay:** what stands above the content, as the context menu and the completion menu are to, in a layer of its own."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC015","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**chrome:** what is drawn around a component that is not its content: a card, a background, a focus ring, a selection; whose it is is open."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC016","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**home:** the start of the page, the field's roots, where every breadcrumb begins; the page also still mounts a store of that name in the browser."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC017","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**site:** a page that starts glass upon stores it names."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC018","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**location:** the integration holding the browser's address and history; the page's query is its param q."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC019","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**brief:** a holon of knowledge giving one understanding, the smaller ones beneath it."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**face:** a brief placed in another's flow, the start of a reading of its own."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**thread:** a question held open in the field, with where it stands."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**session:** a stretch of work with the author, kept whole in his words."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**cycle:** a stretch of a session with one purpose, marked and condensed."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**elevation:** what is lifted out of what was said so it can be seen, statements and topics, standing between the sessions and Knowledge."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**statement:** one sentence under the rule, with its status, its ground, and work where it is something to do."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**topic:** a short name holding statements and topics, spoken of in spans."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**span:** a stretch of a session, written between(session, from, to)."]},"id":"1M89HWGQBHKC01J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
